  "adaptations": [
    "Fixed arrays and worker-time initialization replace callback-local statics/vector allocation",
    "Original FIR coefficients and history offsets retained; independent fixed newest-first history replaces q ring buffer",
    "C++17 memcpy replaces bit_cast; inverse-square-root tiny-input guard and nonnegative square-root radicands",
    "Explicit state reset and 1e-15 float-state tail cutoff",
    "std::pow replaces gcem in center preparation; no claim of bit identity to embedded firmware",
    "One selected voice; fixed 48 kHz; six-sample host adapter; no firmware EQ/dry mix",
    "Nonfinite input becomes zero; input limited to +/-1e6 with sub-1e-15 input floor"
  ],
  "excluded_dependencies": [
    "q (history semantics inspected only)",
